      "writtenOn": "2021-04-12T19:47:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Effectively, this new chip wasn\u0027t planned first to be called icm42607. Marketing ways are sometimes complex to understand.\n\nAnyway, icm426xx is for the old icm426xx family while icm42607 is for the new icm42607 alone. It is difficult to find a correct regex. Perhaps renaming icm426xx to icm42605 (most generic chip of icm426xx \"old\" family). Tell me what you think about.",
