      "message": "What is \"CROS-EC IIO\"? Did you use \u0027tast test \u003cDUT_IP\u003e hardware.SensorRing\u0027 to check the sensor data was flowing to user space?",
      "revId": "2539c16a364d3821a13ccba899d80da0c122c8b8",
