      "message": "That works with me. Using libiio test tool (iio_readdev) is also an open source solution [https://wiki.analog.com/resources/tools-software/linux-software/libiio/iio_readdev]\n\n[something like \u0027iio_readdev -T 10000 -s 4 -b 2 iio:deviceX\u0027]",
      "parentUuid": "d1c9c5be_e9b173fb",
      "revId": "2539c16a364d3821a13ccba899d80da0c122c8b8",
